#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
quick-settings — keyboard-first settings TUI for Alice's Niri rice :3

READS THE LIVE THEME FROM:
    ~/.config/niri/parts/colors.kdl

WRITES ONLY THESE LIVE NIRI FILES:
    ~/.config/niri/parts/input.kdl
    ~/.config/niri/parts/apps.kdl
    ~/.config/niri/parts/layout.kdl
    ~/.config/niri/parts/overview.kdl

It never writes to the dotfiles git repository and never copies anything back to it.
apps.kdl is only modified for spawn/spawn-sh application bindings plus the optional
hyprlock lid-close event. Other bindings are preserved.

Persistent UI config:
    ~/.config/quick-settings/ui.json

Needs:
    python-textual
"""

